: 45.5 x 25.5 cm. Weight: 7.9 kg","desc":"Contrabass button accordion, full reed-plate design, upgraded “Basson-34”. A wonderful deep, mellow sound. In European countries such models are often called accordion-tuba. All the mechanics are made of brass (corrosion-resistant). The instrument has had pre-sale preparation and has been refurbished and upgraded: renewed bellows (leatherette replaced); buttons replaced with Italian mother-of-pearl ones; gasket replaced; material on the openwork grille replaced; supports replaced. Specifications: right keyboard: 34 buttons, 2 voices. Range: D sharp of the contra octave to C of the first octave. Dimensions: 45.5 x 25.5 cm. Weight: 7.9 kg. New leather straps and a gig bag included","features":[]},"537":{"name":"Bugari accordion mod. “115J” – 34/72","short":"Bugari accordion mod. “115J” – 34/72, standard bass (no free-bass system). Right hand: 34 keys, 3 voices, 5 registers. Left hand: 72 buttons. Bass: 4 voices, 2 registers. Dimensions: 40 x 18.5 cm. Weight: 7.4 kg","desc":"Bugari accordion mod. “115J” – 34/72, standard bass (no free-bass system). Right hand: 34 keys, 3 voices, 5 registers. Left hand: 72 buttons. Bass: 4 voices, 2 registers. Dimensions: 40 x 18.5 cm. Weight: 7.4 kg","features":[]},"538":{"name":"Bugari accordion mod. “100J” – 26/48","short":"Bugari accordion mod. “100J” – 26/48, standard bass (no free-bass system). Right hand: 26 keys, 2 voices, 2 registers. Left hand: 48 buttons. Bass: 4 voices. Dimensions: 37 x 17 cm. Weight: 5.7 kg","desc":"Bugari accordion mod. “100J” – 26/48, standard bass (no free-bass system). Right hand: 26 keys, 2 voices, 2 registers. Left hand: 48 buttons. Bass: 4 voices. Dimensions: 37 x 17 cm. Weight: 5.7 kg","features":[]},"539":{"name":"Scandalli accordion “AIR-Junior” 34/72","short":"Scandalli accordion “AIR-Junior” 34/72. Right hand: 34 keys (range: G – E), 4 voices, 11 registers. Left hand: 72 buttons. Bass: 4 voices, 3 registers. Dimensions: 38.5 x 19 cm. Weight: 8.5 kg","des