 (16+8+8), the two middle reeds tuned with a tremolo effect, 7 registers. Left hand: 80 buttons. Bass: 4 voices, 3 registers. Dimensions: 44 x 18.5 cm. Weight: 8.6 kg. Straps and shoulder gig bag included.","desc":"Hohner accordion “Bravo III 80” 37/80. Right hand: 37 keys, range: F – F, 3 voices (16+8+8), the two middle reeds tuned with a tremolo effect, 7 registers. Left hand: 80 buttons. Bass: 4 voices, 3 registers. Dimensions: 44 x 18.5 cm. Weight: 8.6 kg. Straps and shoulder gig bag included.","features":[]},"567":{"name":"Hohner accordion “Bravo III 96” 37/96","short":"Hohner accordion “Bravo III 96” 37/96. Right hand: 37 keys, range: F – F, 3 voices (16+8+8), the two middle reeds tuned with a tremolo effect, 7 registers. Left hand: 96 buttons. Bass: 4 voices, 3 registers. Dimensions: 44 x 18.5 cm. Weight: 8.6 kg. Straps and shoulder gig bag included.","desc":"Hohner accordion “Bravo III 96” 37/96. Right hand: 37 keys, range: F – F, 3 voices (16+8+8), the two middle reeds tuned with a tremolo effect, 7 registers. Left hand: 96 buttons. Bass: 4 voices, 3 registers. Dimensions: 44 x 18.5 cm. Weight: 8.6 kg. Straps and shoulder gig bag included.","features":[]},"568":{"name":"Hohner accordion “Bravo III 120” 41/120","short":"Hohner accordion “Bravo III 120” 41/120. Right hand: 41 keys, range: F – A, 3 voices (16+8+8), the two middle reeds tuned with a tremolo effect, 7 registers. Left hand: 120 buttons. Bass: 4 voices, 3 registers. Dimensions: 48 x 18.5 cm. Weight: 9.2 kg. Straps and shoulder gig bag included.","desc":"Hohner accordion “Bravo III 120” 41/120. Right hand: 41 keys, range: F – A, 3 voices (16+8+8), the two middle reeds tuned with a tremolo effect, 7 registers. Left hand: 120 buttons. Bass: 4 voices, 3 registers. Dimensions: 48 x 18.5 cm. Weight: 9.2 kg. Straps and shoulder gig bag included.","features":[]},"569":{"name":"Hohner Student 26 melodica","short":"Hohner Student 26 melodica. Range: B – C. Brass reeds, plastic body. Length – 35 cm. Weight – 480 g. Colour – red. Mouthpiece and case included.","desc":"Hohner Student 26 melodica. Range: B – C. Brass reeds, plastic body. Length – 35 cm. Weight – 480 g. Colour – red. Mouthpiece and case included.","features":[]},"570":{"name":"Hohner Airboard Multikolor 37 melodica","short":"Hohner Airboard Multikolor 37 melodica. Range: F – F. Brass reeds, plastic body. Length – 56 cm. Weight – 720 g. Colour – red, green, yellow, black. Ergonomic mouthpiece and soft gig bag included","desc":"Hohner Airboard Multikolor 37 melodica. Range: F – F. Brass reeds, plastic body. Length – 56 cm. Weight – 720 g. Colour – red, green, yellow, black. Ergonomic mouthpiece and soft gig bag included","features":[]},"571":{"name":"Microphone system for accordion AC 5001 FX","short":"Harmonik microphone system for accordion AC 5001 FX","desc":"A microphone system that will make your accordion the best! For the first time, the Harmonik AC 5001 FX microphone system offers not only high-quality amplification of the accordion in any hall or at an open-air concert venue, but also adds new possibilities: for the right keyboard, a tremolo (vibrato) effect that can be adjusted to your taste and the needs of the piece, from 0 to a rich musette; for the left keyboard, an additional bass octave that gives a deep, rich bass. Also: independent volume and tone control for the right and left keyboards; mono/stereo output option; elimination of feedback between microphone systems and speaker systems. The best advertisement and guarantee of the quality of these microphone systems is that one of these models is installed in the button accordion of Richard Galliano. It is a signature model developed in close cooperation between the specialists of Harmonik and Richard Galliano. Accordion Center is the official representative of the Brazilian company \"Harmonik\" in Ukraine and offers all the microphone systems made by \"Harmonik\" for piano accordion, button accordion, diatonic accordion, and bandoneon.","features":[]},"572":{"name":"Weltmeister accordion 37/96 (Germany)","short":"Weltmeister accordion 37/96 (Germany). Right hand: 37 keys (range: F – F), 3 voices (16 + 8 + 8), tremolo effect, 5 registers. Left hand: 96 buttons, 4 voices, 3 registers. Dimensions: 45 x 19 cm. Weight: 8.2 kg","desc":"Weltmeister accordion 37/96 (Germany). Right hand: 37 keys (range: F – F), 3 voices (16 + 8 + 8), tremolo effect, 5 registers. Left hand: 96 buttons, 4 voices, 3 registers. Dimensions: 45 x 19 cm. Weight: 8.2 kg. The instrument has had pre-sale preparation using Italian components. New leather straps and a new shoulder gig bag included.","features":[]},"573":{"name":"Anthology for button and piano accordion.","short":"Anthology for button and piano accordion. Volumes 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8. Years of publication: 1985–1991. Each volume can be bought separately.","desc":"Anthology for button and piano accordion. Volumes 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8. Years of publication: 1985–1991. Each volume can be bought separately. Price per volume – 500 UAH.","features":[]}}}};
